# No destructive database resets

`migrate:fresh`, `migrate:refresh`, `migrate:reset`, and `db:wipe` are prohibited in this app (see `AppServiceProvider`). `--force` does not override that.

- Do not run those commands. Do not suggest them as a schema or test fix.
- If a database reset is truly required, stop and ask. Do not proceed without explicit permission.
- Forward-only: `php artisan migrate` or `docker compose run --rm migrate`.
- Local wipe of Docker volumes (`docker compose down -v`) is also destructive. Ask first.

PHPUnit `RefreshDatabase` is the exception; it uses in-memory SQLite and must keep working.
